      "cooked": "<p>What do you really know<br>\nIssue <span class=\"hashtag\">#1:</span> option 2, I think<br>\nissue <span class=\"hashtag\">#2:</span>  wdyrk is indestructible (probably because of this very issue).  That means it can’t leave play<br>\nIssue <span class=\"hashtag\">#3:</span> when a hero is incapped, you remove their deck from the game with the rest of their cards.</p>",
